# BEFORE reproduction for inc-l8ws: Divine Sacrifice follows its source book.
#
# Run from the repository root, with a fresh INCURSION_RUN_DIR under logs/:
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#     INCURSION_RUN_DIR="$PWD/logs/inc-l8ws/before/seed-1" \
#     tools/headless.sh tools/keys/divine-sacrifice.keys 1
#
# WHAT THE OLD SPELL DOES (lib/pspells.irh:1149, before the fix): at cast time
# EV_EFFECT sizes its dice menu by paladin level, charges sac HP at once with
# ThrowDmg, and META(PRE(EV_HIT)) adds (sac/2)d10 to the next hit and removes
# the stati. This priest has no paladin levels, so the menu is one choice and
# the bonus is 1d10 ("DSac").
#
# ROUTE. tools/keys/divine-sacrifice-setup.keys builds a lawful good orc
# priest of Kysul (Good domain), turns on Free Advancement, Infinite Mana and
# Freeze Monsters, learns Divine Sacrifice, and advances him to Priest 3. A
# stunjelly is summoned one square east (low defence once frozen, enough HP to
# survive a hit) and the caster walks into it to attack.
@include divine-sacrifice-setup.keys

# The target: one square east, frozen so it never acts.
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Jellies"
@choose "stunjelly"
RIGHT ENTER
@dump:summoned

# Cast Divine Sacrifice on the caster (self-target).
m
@choose "Divine Sacrifice"
*
@dump:menu
1
@dump:cast

# Walk east into the jelly: the first blow needs confirming. Attack a few
# times so a single unlucky miss (which the old spell does not consume) does
# not hide the bonus; once one hit lands the old spell drops the stati, so
# only that hit carries "DSac".
RIGHT
@while "Confirm attack" y
RIGHT
@while "Confirm attack" y
RIGHT
@while "Confirm attack" y
RIGHT
@while "Confirm attack" y
v
@dump:messages
ESC

@quit
